sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant FE as React Frontend
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant AS as Auth Service
    participant AC as Account Service
    participant TS as Transaction Service
    participant RS as RAG Service
    participant SETU as Setu AA API
    participant LLM as LLM (OpenRouter)
    participant DB as DynamoDB

    Note over User,DB: ─────── Phase 1: Authentication ───────
    User->>FE: Enter credentials
    FE->>GW: POST /auth/login
    GW->>AS: Forward request
    AS->>DB: Verify user credentials
    DB-->>AS: User record (BCrypt hash match)
    AS-->>GW: JWT Token (RS256 signed)
    GW-->>FE: JWT Token + refresh token
    FE-->>User: Dashboard loaded

    Note over User,DB: ─────── Phase 2: Consent Creation ───────
    User->>FE: Click "New Consent"
    FE->>GW: POST /account/consents [Bearer JWT]
    GW->>GW: JWT Validation ✅
    GW->>AC: Forward: POST /consents
    AC->>SETU: POST /consents (FIP, date range, frequency)
    SETU-->>AC: Consent handle + redirect URL
    AC->>DB: Store consent (PENDING status)
    AC-->>GW: Consent URL
    GW-->>FE: Consent URL
    FE-->>User: Redirect to Setu approval page

    Note over User,DB: ─────── Phase 3: Consent Approval & Data Fetch ───────
    User->>SETU: Approve consent (Setu portal)
    SETU->>AC: Webhook: CONSENT_APPROVED
    AC->>DB: Update consent status → ACTIVE
    AC->>SETU: POST /fetch (FI data request)
    SETU-->>AC: Encrypted FI data (multi-bank)
    AC->>TS: POST /transactions (parsed FI data)
    TS->>DB: Bulk write transactions (GSI indexed)
    TS-->>AC: 200 OK

    Note over User,DB: ─────── Phase 4: AI Chat Query ───────
    User->>FE: Select consent + click "Ingest Data"
    FE->>GW: POST /ai/ingest [Bearer JWT]
    GW->>RS: Forward: POST /ingest
    RS->>DB: Fetch user transactions
    DB-->>RS: Transaction list (JSON)
    RS->>RS: Format transactions → Document text
    RS->>RS: HuggingFace: Generate embeddings (384-dim)
    RS->>RS: Build FAISS index (per user_id)
    RS-->>FE: Ingestion complete

    User->>FE: Type: "Show high-value UPI transactions"
    FE->>GW: POST /ai/prompt [Bearer JWT]
    GW->>RS: Forward: POST /prompt
    RS->>RS: QueryModeDetector → VECTOR_SEARCH
    RS->>RS: FilterExtractor → {mode: UPI, threshold: high}
    RS->>RS: FAISS k-NN search (k=50)
    RS->>LLM: Prompt + top-50 context (OpenRouter API)
    LLM-->>RS: AI response stream (SSE chunks)
    RS-->>FE: Stream: metadata → chunks → done
    FE-->>User: Formatted table + analysis

    Note over User,DB: ─────── Phase 5: Export ───────
    User->>FE: Click "Export PDF"
    FE->>GW: GET /transactions/export/pdf [Bearer JWT]
    GW->>TS: Forward: GET /export/pdf
    TS->>DB: Fetch all user transactions
    DB-->>TS: Transactions
    TS->>TS: Generate PDF (iText/Apache POI)
    TS-->>FE: Binary PDF stream
    FE-->>User: Download PDF file
